.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIresult\fP - where to store the address of the composed string 
.br
\fIfmt\fP - the format-string to use in composition, see printf() 
.br
\fI...\fP - the parameters for the -substitutions in the format-string, see printf()
.RE
.PP

.SS "int ecat (char ** result,  ...)"
.PP
